{"strings": [
  {"text":"Hope","translation":"희망 · Hope","where":"worlds/hope-lantern/scenes/hope/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"The lantern burns as long as someone is waiting.","translation":"누군가 기다리는 동안 등불은 타오른다.","where":"worlds/hope-lantern/scenes/hope/scene.json caption"},
  {"text":"Every evening she comes to the old pier.","translation":"매일 저녁 그녀는 오래된 부두에 온다.","where":"worlds/hope-lantern/scenes/hope/scene.json captions[0] text"},
  {"text":"And lights the lantern.","translation":"그리고 등불을 켠다.","where":"worlds/hope-lantern/scenes/hope/scene.json captions[1] text"},
  {"text":"So that from the far shore they can see where to row.","translation":"건너편 기슭에서 어디로 저어 와야 할지 보이도록.","where":"worlds/hope-lantern/scenes/hope/scene.json captions[2] text"},
  {"text":"Over there it's still dark.","translation":"저쪽은 아직 어둡다.","where":"worlds/hope-lantern/scenes/hope/scene.json captions[3] text"},
  {"text":"But the lantern burns.","translation":"하지만 등불은 타오른다.","where":"worlds/hope-lantern/scenes/hope/scene.json captions[4] text"}
]}
